package org.schabi.newpipe.settings.export

/**
 * Setting keys that exist in other NewPipe forks but not in Tubular. They are kept when a backup
 * is imported (so a later export still contains them) and remembered, so that they can be removed
 * again with "clear data from other apps".
 *
 * Generated by diffing PipePipe's settings_keys.xml against Tubular's and dropping every key
 * Tubular's own source mentions, so clearing can never remove something Tubular uses. Keys both
 * apps share (e.g. the scheduled backup ones) are deliberately not listed.
 */
